---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Ali Ansar | Full-Stack Web & Android Developer" description="Meet Ali Ansar, a software developer working across full-stack web development and native Android, with a focus on clear UX and maintainable engineering.">
	<main class="about-shell">
		<header class="about-hero">
			<div class="portrait-frame"><img src="/projects/portfolio-preview.png" alt="A preview of Ali Ansar's software developer portfolio" /></div>
			<div>
				<span class="section-label">About me</span>
				<h1>Engineer-minded.<br /><em>Product focused.</em></h1>
				<p class="intro">I’m Ali Ansar — a software developer who enjoys turning a good idea into a useful digital product.</p>
				<p>My work spans native Android apps and full-stack web development. I care about the details people notice — a clear layout, a smooth flow, a quick page — and the engineering underneath that keeps a product reliable as it grows.</p>
				<a class="button" href="/contact/">Let’s work together <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<section class="values">
			<div><span class="section-label">How I work</span><h2>Good work is thoughtful at every layer.</h2></div>
			<div class="value-grid">
				<article><span>01</span><h3>Start with people</h3><p>Understand who the product is for and make the important tasks feel straightforward.</p></article>
				<article><span>02</span><h3>Keep it maintainable</h3><p>Use clear structure and reusable patterns so the product can evolve without unnecessary friction.</p></article>
				<article><span>03</span><h3>Build with intent</h3><p>Balance visual polish with performance, accessibility, and real-world usefulness.</p></article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="experience">
			<div><span class="section-label">What I build</span><h2>Across web and mobile.</h2><p>From company websites and custom web apps to Android applications, I help shape complete product experiences.</p></div>
			<div class="experience-list">
				<div><strong>Web development</strong><span>React · Next.js · Node.js · Express · MongoDB</span></div>
				<div><strong>Android development</strong><span>Kotlin · Jetpack Compose · Firebase · MVVM</span></div>
				<div><strong>Selected work</strong><span>NexVion Sportswear · DubaiAd · CampusNotify</span></div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-shell { width: min(1030px, calc(100% - 3rem)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 4.2rem 0 5rem; }
	.about-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
	.portrait-frame { overflow: hidden; padding: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid #24364c; border-radius: 1.1rem; background: #101827; transform: rotate(-1deg); }
	.portrait-frame img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 0.88; border-radius: 0.7rem; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; }
	.section-label { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
	.about-hero h1 { margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.06em; }
	.about-hero h1 em { color: #38bdf8; font-style: normal; }
	.about-hero p { color: #9aa9bd; font-size: 0.9rem; }
	.about-hero .intro { color: #dce7f5; font-size: 1.03rem; }
	.button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.65rem; background: #38bdf8; color: #04111d; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; }
	.values { margin-top: 6rem; }
	.values h2, .experience h2 { margin: 0.45rem 0 1.3rem; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.045em; }
	.value-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
	.value-grid article { padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid #1d2a3c; border-radius: 0.85rem; background: #0e1624; }
	.value-grid article > span { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; }
	.value-grid h3 { margin: 1.1rem 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
	.value-grid p, .experience > div > p { margin-bottom: 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.83rem; }
	.experience { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 3rem; margin-top: 5rem; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid #1d2a3c; border-radius: 1rem; background: #0d1522; }
	.experience h2 { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
	.experience-list { display: grid; align-content: center; }
	.experience-list div { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e2a3b; }
	.experience-list div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
	.experience-list strong { font-size: 0.86rem; }
	.experience-list span { color: #91a0b5; font-size: 0.78rem; }
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.about-shell { padding-top: 3rem; }
		.about-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.portrait-frame { max-width: 490px; }
		.portrait-frame img { aspect-ratio: 1.6; }
		.value-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.experience { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.4rem; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.about-shell { width: calc(100% - 2.5rem); }
		.values { margin-top: 4rem; }
		.experience { margin-top: 3.5rem; padding: 1.3rem; }
	}
</style>
